# Activity log — <ISO8601 timestamp> [<actor>/<role>] <action>
# actor: user | claude | codex   role: free-form (for example overseer, worker, sub-master, Karma)
# See RULES.md #11. Append one line per tool run or user-confirmed action,
# whether the session ran it or the user did.
# Handoff actions additionally use: handoff=<id> parent=<id|none>
# action=<created|updated|reviewed|returned>
